'' __FB_EVAL__ whose folded result contains a quote emits it raw, which is what makes
'' the corpus's '__FB_UNQUOTE__( __FB_EVAL__( ... __FB_QUOTE__( tmp ) ) )' assignment
'' idiom work for a STRING value -- see the source for the fbc measurements.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir tests/pp/src/eval-embedded-quote.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-OUT: 0 statements not lowered
'' GOLDEN: expected/eval-embedded-quote.out
